Description: C17 network daemon, Kotlin controller, and terminal dashboard
 clambhook provides a C17 network client daemon, frozen HTTP/WebSocket control
 API, a self-contained Kotlin/Compose desktop controller with a private
 runtime, a terminal dashboard, and the license helper used for trial and
 license activation. Supported on Ubuntu; packages and the apt repository are
 signed with the developer@jpfchang.org release key.
